{"id":"refugiado","lemma":"refugiado","pos":"adj","rank":4367,"glosses":["related to refugees"],"ipa":"/refuˈxjado/","forms":{"feminine":"refugiada","masculinePlural":"refugiados","femininePlural":"refugiadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-refugiado.wav","formAudio":{"refugiados":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-refugiados.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Los refugiados lucharon contra el hambre.","en":"The refugees struggled against hunger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703539","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to fight","l":"luchar"},{"g":"antidote"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"hunger"}]},{"text":"Tom es un refugiado.","en":"Tom is a refugee.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Los refugiados huyeron por poco de la muerte.","en":"The refugees barely escaped death.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to flee, to run away","l":"huir"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"death"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"almost"],[5,7,"of the"]]},{"text":"Los refugiados se sintieron seguros en su nuevo país.","en":"The refugees felt safe in their new country.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65035","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to feel","l":"sentir"},{"g":"secure","l":"seguro"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"new"},{"g":"country"}]},{"text":"Los refugiados supervivientes aspiraban a la libertad.","en":"The surviving refugees longed for freedom.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"surviving","l":"superviviente"},null,{"g":"to"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"a region of Peru"]]}]}